# Project Ledger

Canonical protocol: **`docs/agent-protocol.md`** and **`AGENTS.md`**.

Before non-trivial implementation: requirement → current SPEC revision → ADRs → plan → agent run → evidence.
Never rewrite immutable SOW/SPEC/ADR history. Run `npx project-ledger validate` (or `pnpm ledger validate`) before claiming ledger completion.

This rule is the Cursor adapter — Claude Code uses `CLAUDE.md` / `.claude/rules/`; all harnesses share the same protocol file.
